        "node_id": "n_3_d97c6d",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous implementation was that it didn't correctly handle the case where the number of operations exceeded the time limit. The function was returning \"AC\" for cases where the operations were less than or equal to the time limit, which is incorrect. I need to modify the comparison logic to return \"TLE\" when the operations exceed the time limit.",
